=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904640/extras/d5041b410e1cf103a3d356db33a4ed4b.mp4?t=1754084443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Go on clicker quests, collect ingredients, craft unique items, and help out your furry (and sometimes scaly, hairy, slimy, or feathery) friends. Unlock special digger skins and create an unstoppable collection of characters.<br><br><strong>And much more:</strong><br>\u26cf\ufe0f research digging <br>\u26cf\ufe0f clicker gameplay<br>\u26cf\ufe0f tasks <br>\u26cf\ufe0f incremental progression<br>\u26cf\ufe0f benefactors <br>\u26cf\ufe0f idle progression<br>\u26cf\ufe0f planet shops <br>\u26cf\ufe0f challenge mode <br>\u26cf\ufe0f golden worms <br>\u26cf\ufe0f offline mining modes <br>\u26cf\ufe0f geode prizes <br>\u26cf\ufe0f treasure chests <br>\u26cf\ufe0f big bangs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN OUR DISCORD</h2>",
